Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:01.16,Short,,0,0,0,,Some people really are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:02.62,Short,,0,0,0,,mosquito magnets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:03.98,Short,,0,0,0,,Only females bite
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:04.82,Short,,0,0,0,,They need blood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.78,Short,,0,0,0,,to make eggs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:06.94,Short,,0,0,0,,First, she follows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:07.72,Short,,0,0,0,,your breath
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:08.90,Short,,0,0,0,,the carbon dioxide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:09.52,Short,,0,0,0,,from up to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:10.54,Short,,0,0,0,,thirty feet away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:11.42,Short,,0,0,0,,Up close
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.78,Short,,0,0,0,,she smells your skin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.28,Short,,0,0,0,,Your skin makes oils
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:14.92,Short,,0,0,0,,and bacteria
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:15.86,Short,,0,0,0,,turn them into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:17.26,Short,,0,0,0,,your own personal scent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:18.43,Short,,0,0,0,,In one study
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:19.02,Short,,0,0,0,,people wore
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:20.10,Short,,0,0,0,,nylon stockings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:20.84,Short,,0,0,0,,on their arms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:21.68,Short,,0,0,0,,and the mosquitoes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:22.76,Short,,0,0,0,,picked one person
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:23.90,Short,,0,0,0,,a hundred times more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:24.60,Short,,0,0,0,,than another
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:26.04,Short,,0,0,0,,That person's skin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:26.98,Short,,0,0,0,,made far more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.02,Short,,0,0,0,,of certain acids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:29.12,Short,,0,0,0,,and it stayed that way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:29.88,Short,,0,0,0,,for years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:31.02,Short,,0,0,0,,So if you always
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:32.10,Short,,0,0,0,,get bitten first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:33.24,Short,,0,0,0,,it's not bad luck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.49,0:00:33.97,Short,,0,0,0,,It's because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:30.05,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho always gets bitten
